go-misc
=======

A collection of small Go exercises and experiments.

Author: @c_piekarski
Originally written 2011-2013; modernized to Go modules.

Layout
------
  fibo/    pell/    sort/    tree/    myhttp/    -- library packages
  cmd/                                          -- runnable programs
    calcfibo  calcpell  myserver  gowiki  hello
  legacy/                                       -- old experiments that no
                                                   longer build (see its README)

Build / run
-----------
  go run ./cmd/calcfibo -i 10
  go run ./cmd/calcpell -i 10
  go run ./cmd/myserver        # serves myhttp/data.html through ROT13 on :12345
  go run ./cmd/gowiki          # run from cmd/gowiki so it finds its templates

Test
----
  go test ./...
  go test ./fibo -bench=.      # benchmarks
